or best results. Our specialist will provide specific preparation instructions when you book. Generally, minimal preparation is needed.\"},{\"question\":\"How long do the results last?\",\"answer\":\"Results vary based on individual factors and the specific service. Our beard coloring typically provides lasting benefits, and we\'ll give you aftercare tips to maximize longevity.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the cost of this service?\",\"answer\":\"Pricing varies based on the specific treatment and any add-ons you choose. We offer competitive rates with package deals for regular clients. All prices are listed upfront on our platform - no surprise charges.\"},{\"question\":\"How do I book an appointment?\",\"answer\":\"Booking is easy through our app or website. Select your desired service, choose a convenient date and time, and confirm. You\'ll receive instant confirmation and a reminder before your appointment.\"},{\"question\":\"Are your professionals trained and certified?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, all our beauty professionals are certified, trained, and experienced in their respective specialties. They stay updated with the latest techniques and trends through ongoing education and workshops.\"},{\"question\":\"What should I do before my appointment?\",\"answer\":\"Arrive with clean skin\\/hair (depending on service). Avoid applying heavy makeup or products beforehand. Inform us of any allergies or sensitivities. We\'ll handle the rest and ensure you have a relaxing experience.\"},{\"question\":\"What if I\'m not satisfied with the results?\",\"answer\":\"Your satisfaction is our priority. If you\'re unhappy with any aspect of the service, let us know immediately. We\'ll make it right - whether that means adjustments, a redo, or a refund, depending on the situation.\"}]', '0', '0', 1),
